ites that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"type":"topic","title":"Swami","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/accessibilityAction(_:_:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/accessibilityaction(_:_:)","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/accessibilityAction(_:_:)","role":"symbol","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","title":"accessibilityAction(_:_:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"accessibilityAction","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI23AccessibilityActionKindV","text":"AccessibilityActionKind","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", () -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","text":"Void","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI15ModifiedContentV","text":"ModifiedContent","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI31AccessibilityAttachmentModifierV","text":"AccessibilityAttachmentModifier","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Drags a layer in any direction with momentum and rubber-band bounds.